                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 3794,
                            "last_played": 1792549362
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Excellent game with fantastic gameplay.\nOST is good, Replayability is good, gameplay is excellent.\nDifficulty is a strong suit for the game, as you decide what missions you do and every mission has a difficulty associated with it. There is little in the game ever forcing you to take a harder mission then you want, so you can scale your difficulty as you play at whatever pace you wish. \nMastering this game feels really good. Figuring out different ways you can use all the different items and equipment you can find feels extremely rewarding.\nI think this game is very underated, and that it stands the test of time. Very recommend",
